   "text": "Relax, we're just talking. He's the strong, silent type."
  },
  {
   "id": "04",
   "t0": 6.93,
   "t1": 9.03,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "He's the strong, silent, snap-your-neck type."
  },
  {
   "id": "05",
   "t0": 9.03,
   "t1": 10.82,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Rude. Look at those cheekbones."
  },
  {
   "id": "06",
   "t0": 10.82,
   "t1": 12.69,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "That's SCP-173."
  },
  {
   "id": "07",
   "t0": 12.69,
   "t1": 13.71,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Is that his number?"
  },
  {
   "id": "08",
   "t0": 13.71,
   "t1": 15.64,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "It moves when nobody's looking at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "09",
   "t0": 15.64,
   "t1": 16.82,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Aww, so he's shy."
  },
  {
   "id": "10",
   "t0": 16.82,
   "t1": 19.95,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "One blink. That's all he needs to cross this room and break your neck."
  },
  {
   "id": "11",
   "t0": 19.95,
   "t1": 22.22,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "What happened to the last girl who stared at him?"
  },
  {
   "id": "12",
   "t0": 22.22,
   "t1": 23.24,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "Which part of her?"
  },
  {
   "id": "13",
   "t0": 23.24,
   "t1": 25.25,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Okay, but he'd have to make the first move."
  },
  {
   "id": "14",
   "t0": 25.25,
   "t1": 27.27,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "That… is literally the problem."
  },
  {
   "id": "15",
   "t0": 27.27,
   "t1": 30.88,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "And every week somebody mops his cell. Nobody knows what that red stuff is."
  },
  {
   "id": "16",
   "t0": 30.88,
   "t1": 32.44,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "A man who leaves a mess. Red flag."
  },
  {
   "id": "17",
   "t0": 32.44,
   "t1": 35.6,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Fine. I'll stare at him all night. I'm amazing at eye contact."
  },
  {
   "id": "18",
   "t0": 35.6,
   "t1": 37.54,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "Then why are you holding eye drops?"
  },
  {
   "id": "19",
   "t0": 37.54,
   "t1": 39.28,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "My eyes get dry when I flirt."
  },
  {
   "id": "20",
   "t0": 39.28,
   "t1": 41.27,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "Wait, wait, wait. You put those in. In here."
  },
  {
   "id": "21",
   "t0": 41.27,
   "t1": 43.67,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Only one eye! The other one was watching him."
  },
  {
   "id": "22",
   "t0": 43.67,
   "t1": 44.36,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "…Which one?"
  },
  {
   "id": "23",
   "t0": 44.36,
   "t1": 45.24,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "…Oh."
  },
  {
   "id": "24",
   "t0": 45.24,
   "t1": 48.09,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "Protocol is three people in here. You blink, you say it out loud."
  },
  {
   "id": "25",
   "t0": 48.09,
   "t1": 49.83,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Three? Two is way more romantic."
  },
  {
   "id": "26",
   "t0": 49.83,
   "t1": 50.65,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "Don't."
  },
  {
   "id": "27",
   "t0": 50.65,
   "t1": 52.43,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Is that a no, or a not-in-front-of-him?"
  },
  {
   "id": "28",
   "t0": 52.43,
   "t1": 53.5,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "It's a no."
  },
  {
   "id": "29",
   "t0": 53.5,
   "t1": 55.36,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "Your eyes are kinda pretty, by the way."
  },
  {
   "id": "30",
   "t0": 55.36,
   "t1": 57.01,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "You can't even see my eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "31",
   "t0": 57.01,
   "t1": 57.81,
   "spk": "airy",
   "text": "I can tell."
  },
  {
   "id": "32",
   "t0": 57.81,
   "t1": 59.81,
   "spk": null,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "33",
   "t0": 59.81,
   "t1": 63.0,
   "spk": "guard",
   "text": "…Neither of us is looking at him, are we?"
